# The certificate lives here at run time and never in the repository.
#
# A real deployment points TLS_CERT_DIR at whatever its ACME client writes. For
# a local test, a throwaway pair is one command:
#
#   openssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:2048 -nodes -days 1 \
#     -keyout privkey.pem -out fullchain.pem -subj "/CN=localhost"
*.pem
